# 3D AI-Based E-commerce Store - External Evaluation Guide

## Project Overview
This is a comprehensive 3D AI-based e-commerce platform that integrates advanced 3D visualization, AI-powered features, and modern web technologies to create an immersive shopping experience.

### Technology Stack
- **Frontend:** Next.js 14, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Three.js, React Three Fiber
- **Backend:** Django REST Framework, Python 3.11
- **Database:** PostgreSQL/SQLite
- **3D Rendering:** WebGL, Three.js, GLB/GLTF models
- **AI Integration:** Custom AI chatbot, product recommendations
- **Authentication:** JWT-based authentication
- **Storage:** Supabase for media files

