## Quick Start Guide

### Prerequisites
- Node.js 18+
- Python 3.11+
- PostgreSQL (optional, SQLite included)

### Setup Commands
```bash
# Backend Setup
cd backend
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate  # Windows
pip install -r requirements.txt
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py runserver

# Frontend Setup
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev